+// Read-only deep integrity verification for a sealed zvec collection.
+//
+// The verifier never creates, repairs or rewrites storage. It takes a shared
+// advisory lock on the owning storage generation (when present), refuses an
+// actively written generation, and then walks the collection:
+//
+//   * Proxima files: header/footer/segment-table CRCs, declared sizes, content
+//     CRC (when requested) and per-segment CRCs when the writer supplied them.
+//   * RocksDB directories: read-only open with paranoid checks plus
+//     VerifyChecksum, covering SST, MANIFEST and column-family metadata.
+//   * Arrow IPC files: footer, schema and every record batch.
+//   * zg reconciliation sidecars (file-XXXXXXXX.bin): bounded structural
+//     validation of the ZGM2 compact manifest layout.
+//
+// WAL bytes are not verified. Any RocksDB log file makes WAL coverage
+// explicitly "unsupported" instead of being silently promoted to complete.
+
